| Search | PostgreSQL FTS + pgvector + RRF |
| Assets | R2/object storage |
| Premium video | Mux |
| Native player | SaintxVerse Studio Player |
| External media | Provider adapters |
| Games | Phaser |
| App framework | Next.js App Router |
| UI | React + TypeScript |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS v4 + semantic CSS tokens |
| Client state | Small purpose-specific Zustand stores |
