# 2. THE FOUR SAINTXVERSE STATE AXES

The system must never collapse identity, visual theme, language and discovery into a single "mode."

They are separate axes.

```ts
type Identity = 'karim' | 'saint';

type Appearance =
  | 'light'
  | 'dark'
  | 'system';

type Locale =
  | 'en'
  | 'ar';

interface VerseState {
  identity: Identity;
  appearance: Appearance;
  locale: Locale;

  reducedMotion: boolean;
  reducedEffects: boolean;

  discovery: DiscoveryState;
}
```

This allows:

```text
Karim + Light + English
Karim + Dark + Arabic

Saint + Dark + English
Saint + Light + Arabic
```

without architectural hacks.

## Default presentation

```text
Karim → light
Saint → dark
```

These are defaults, not restrictions.

A visitor may choose otherwise.

