# 14. LOCALIZATION

Do not put locale inside arbitrary JSON.

Create localized projection content.

```sql
create table projection_localizations (
  id uuid primary key default gen_random_uuid(),

  projection_id uuid not null
    references entity_projections(id)
    on delete cascade,

  locale text not null,

  title text,
  eyebrow text,
  summary text,
  body jsonb not null default '{}'::jsonb,

  seo_title text,
  seo_description text,

  unique(projection_id, locale)
);
```

Initial locales:

```text
en
ar
```

Store direction at locale configuration level:

```ts
const locales = {
  en: { direction: 'ltr' },
  ar: { direction: 'rtl' }
};
```

Set:

```html
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
```

Arabic is not an English layout with text reversed.

Navigation, directional icons, breadcrumb arrows, carousel directions, text alignment and spatial relationships need RTL review.

