# 17. OBJECT STORAGE

Use [Cloudflare R2](https://developers.cloudflare.com/r2/?utm_source=chatgpt.com) for:

```text
source artwork
optimized artwork
audio masters
audio renditions
downloadables
project files
game assets
3D assets
analysis sidecars
waveform data
private source material
```

R2 currently charges for storage and operations but does not charge Internet egress bandwidth. Other metered services connected to R2 may still charge their own fees.

Therefore the correct statement is:

**R2 has zero R2 Internet egress charges.**

Not:

**all media delivery is free.**

Current Standard storage pricing is $0.015/GB-month before request charges, so the older "$5–10/TB" estimate in the research document should not be used for budgeting.

