# 19. VIDEO QUALITY POLICY

SaintxVerse should classify content.

```text
CINEMATIC MASTER
→ Mux Plus/Premium
→ 4K where source merits it

MUSIC VIDEO
→ Plus/Premium
→ up to 4K

PROJECT DEMO
→ Basic/Plus
→ usually 1080p

