# 21. PLAYER STATE MACHINE

```text
IDLE
 │
 ▼
LOADING
 │
 ├── failure → ERROR
 │
 ▼
READY
 │
 ├── play → PLAYING
 │
 └── seek → SEEKING
        │
        ▼
PLAYING
 │
 ├── pause → PAUSED
 ├── seek → SEEKING
 ├── ended → NEXT
 └── error → ERROR
```

Do not let React rerender 60 times per second because `currentTime` changed.

High-frequency playback state should remain close to the media engine.

UI state can update at controlled intervals.

