# 33. HYBRID RRF SEARCH

Pipeline:

```text
QUERY
 │
 ├─────────────┐
 ▼             ▼
FTS         EMBEDDING
 │             │
 ▼             ▼
TOP N         TOP N
 │             │
 └──────┬──────┘
        ▼
       RRF
        │
        ▼
 exact boosts
        │
        ▼
 permissions
        │
        ▼
 results
```

Formula:

\[
RRF(d)=
\frac{1}{k+r_{fts}(d)}
+
\frac{1}{k+r_{vec}(d)}
\]

Start with:

```text
k = 60
candidate pool = 50–100 per retriever
```

but tune from measured relevance.

